   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(12,100,192)\">\r\n<b>Interactive introductory distance sampling training</b></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThe University of St Andrews has been training ecologists and statisticians in design and analysis of distance sampling studies for decades. Distance sampling methods are widely used in population assessment of many different taxonomic groups. Perhaps you&#39;ve\r\n wanted to attend a previous workshop, but schedules conflicted with your field work. 👨‍🌾</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nWe are offering the training workshop in 10 2.5-hour blocks in October 2025.  You will be invited to interact in short lectures on distance sampling principles. 👩‍🎓 Exercises analysing data sets in R will reinforce those principles and the lecturer will be\r\n available to assist during the practical session via screen sharing.  The session will conclude with a summary of the exercise and question/answer session for both lecture and exercise. 💻  You can participate in polls during the workshop to assess your comprehension\r\n of topics discussed. 🤔 In addition to questions at any time during the lectures and practicals, an optional additional half hour will be set aside each session for discussion of topics arising. 🗣</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nSimultaneous translation of lectures and discussions will be available in closed captions courtesy of Zoom. If English is not your first language, translation will be available into (most) languages. Contact instructor for more details.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThe workshop will be delivered using Zoom web conferencing software along with R-Studio &quot;in the cloud&quot;.☁️ You will need (free) accounts for both pieces of software. I encourage you to experiment with Zoom (at <a href=\"https://zoom.us\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://zoom.us&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471502566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1x2a8f8EBxQo7wWiLXQCJ3\">https://zoom.us</a>) and R-Studio (<a href=\"https://posit.cloud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://posit.cloud&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471502566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3jz0g59WRuv1HqULiGmHwF\">https://posit.cloud</a>)\r\n before the workshop begins. 👩‍💻  There will be an internet connection testing and general orientation session the week of 29 September 2025.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(12,100,192)\">\r\n<b>Important details</b></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;list-style-type:disc\">\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div role=\"presentation\">Workshop dates and time:  <span style=\"color:rgb(134,17,6)\">\r\n<b>06-17 October 2025</b></span>; 1400-1630 British Summer Time.</div>\r\n</li><ul style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;list-style-type:circle\">\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div role=\"presentation\">For the time of day in your time zone, consult <a href=\"https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Introductory+distance+sampling+workshop&amp;iso=20251006T14&amp;p1=3853&amp;ah=2&amp;am=30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg%3DIntroductory%2Bdistance%2Bsampling%2Bworkshop%26iso%3D20251006T14%26p1%3D3853%26ah%3D2%26am%3D30&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471502566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3DV8uU0jHFRWWk9s50C53V\">https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Introductory+distance+sampling+workshop&amp;iso=20251006T14&amp;p1=3853&amp;ah=2&amp;am=30</a>🕰️</div>\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div role=\"presentation\">Registration deadline: <span style=\"color:rgb(134,17,6)\">\r\n<b>26 September 2025</b></span>📅</div>\r\n</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div role=\"presentation\">Enrolment limit: 17</div>\r\n</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div role=\"presentation\">Cost: 225 British pounds 💵</div>\r\n</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div role=\"presentation\">What is included: Lectures, exercises, code, data all available online📃</div>\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(12,100,192)\">\r\n<b>Widening participation scholarship</b></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nOne place will have the registration fee waived, for participants from under-represented groups.  Details of eligibility and application process at <a href=\"https://distancesampling.org/training/scholarships.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://distancesampling.org/training/scholarships.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471502566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0r3Re3KdpqE1lL3cyzD4p2\">https://distancesampling.org/training/scholarships.html</a>. Deadline for scholarship application for the October\r\n 2025 introductory workshop is <span style=\"color:rgb(134,17,6)\"><b>25 August 2025</b></span>.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(12,100,192)\">\r\n<b>What they are saying</b></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin-left:0.8ex;padding-left:1ex;border-left:3px solid rgb(200,200,200)\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nI would like to say I really liked RStudio Cloud and it is working just fine and I am really enjoying using it as a student. I&#39;m looking forward to using it as an instructor too. I really liked the first half of the course. I love distance sampling and I am\r\n enjoying every second of the course! The only thing I can say about this particular workshop is it deserves more time. -- Kaan Özgencil, PhD, Department of Biological Sciences, Middle East Technical University, Ankara</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(12,100,192)\">\r\n<b>Further details and registration</b></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a title=\"https://distancesampling.org/training/announcements/intro-oct-2025.html\" href=\"https://distancesampling.org/training/announcements/intro-oct-2025.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://distancesampling.org/training/announcements/intro-oct-2025.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471502566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3NFhNBCiVEGGVdW0CL8UPE\">https://distancesampling.org/training/announcements/intro-oct-2025.html</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nWithin the webpage above, you will find a link to the St Andrews online shop where payment is made.  After you registration, I will contact you with additional details regarding workshop electronic materials, etc.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nFeel free to contact me with questions.  Note, this is the final workshop I will be delivering. Please share this announcement with interested colleagues 🏢.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nInformation regarding all distance sampling workshops can be found at</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a href=\"https://distancesampling.org/training/training.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://distancesampling.org/training/training.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471502566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw234ufSmyIhs0tLNcEGeCr_\">https://distancesampling.org/training/training.html</a></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Eric Rexstad</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(12,100,192)\">Centre for Research into Ecological and Environmental Modelling</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">University of St Andrews</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Registered Charity in Scotland SC013532</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
